# Include the Dev Link

After every update, reply, or completed change, include the local development URL in the user-facing message.

- Default: [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000)
- If the running `next dev` process is on a different port, use that URL instead
- Put the link near the end of the response so it is easy to find
